---
layout: base.njk
title: Business Overview
permalink: /business-overview/
---
{% set liveDivisions = products.categories | rejectattr("draft") | list %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-media" style="background-image:url('/assets/projects/building.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Business Overview</h1>
    <p>A diversified group built over four decades — from construction materials to energy, finance and automotive.</p>
    <div class="page-hero-stats">
      <div class="page-hero-stat"><span class="num">{{ liveDivisions.length }}</span><span class="sub">Business sectors</span></div>
      <div class="page-hero-stat"><span class="num">40<span class="plus">+</span></span><span class="sub">Years of experience</span></div>
      <div class="page-hero-stat"><span class="num">7<span class="plus">+</span></span><span class="sub">Branches nationwide</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-white">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px; text-align:center; margin:0 auto 48px;">
    <h2>One group, {{ {"5":"five","6":"six","7":"seven","8":"eight"}[liveDivisions.length | string] or liveDivisions.length }} sectors</h2>
    <p class="section-lead" style="margin:14px auto 0;">HRGG began as a construction-materials trading business in the 1970s. Four decades on, it has grown into a diversified group with interests spanning construction, energy, finance and automotive — each sector held to the same standard of quality and trust.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap divisions-grid grid grid-3">
    {% for cat in products.categories %}
    <a class="division-card" href="/business-overview/{{ cat.slug }}/">
      <div class="division-card-media">
        <img src="{{ cat.image }}" alt="{{ cat.name }}" loading="lazy" style="object-position: {{ cat.heroPosition or 'center' }};">
        <span class="division-card-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="division-card-body">
        <h3>{{ cat.name }}{% if cat.draft %} <span class="badge-draft">Coming soon</span>{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>{{ cat.summary }}</p>
        {% if cat.items.length %}<p class="division-card-meta">{{ cat.items.length }} key partner{% if cat.items.length != 1 %}s{% endif %} / brands in this sector</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "enquiry-cta.njk" %}
